# This repo is PUBLIC and contains documentation only — no build, no deps, no state.
# Anything appearing here is something a tool dropped in the working directory by
# accident, so the list is deliberately blunt.
#
# .wrangler/ is the reason this file exists: a wrangler command run with the wrong
# working directory left .wrangler/cache/wrangler-account.json here, carrying a real
# Cloudflare account id. It was untracked and never pushed, but it should not have
# been possible to add it by reflex with `git add -A`.
.wrangler/
node_modules/
.env
*.env
.DS_Store
